# Keep the image lean: core/, gitlab/, github/, and ci/ are COPYed, but trim
# the build context so unrelated changes don't bust the layer cache. `.github`
# is the workflows dir (excluded); `github/` is the SCM adapter (kept).
.git
.github
e2e
docs
gitlab/e2e
**/__pycache__
**/*.md
action.yaml
LICENSE
